<title>DUBAI: Shell Oman open for subscription July 19.</title>
<headline>Shell Oman open for subscription July 19.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Oman Marketing Co, a Royal Dutch/Shell Group subsidiary, will be open for public subscription on the Muscat stock market on July 19, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Four million shares worth 19.6 million Omani rials would be on offer in Shell's retail marketing division.</p>
<p>The share-offer is one of the largest public offering in the Gulf state. Share trading is expected to start in September.</p>
<p>The Anglo-Dutch oil group will maintain a 49 percent stake in the new firm.</p>
<p>($1=0.377 Omani rials).</p>
</text>
